# AI context exclusion manifest
#
# Purpose: keep local AI tooling from glob-loading historical, generated, or
# evidence-only Markdown into default prompts. This complements `.gitignore`;
# tools that support custom ignore manifests should honor these patterns.

.history/**
docs/archive/**
docs/evidence/**
docs/reference/**
node_modules/**
dist/**
build/**
release/**
playwright-report/**
test-results/**
coverage/**
compliance/**

# Evidence and generated report patterns
**/*STATUS*.md
**/*SUMMARY*.md
**/*COMPLETE*.md
**/*COMPLETION*.md
**/*AUDIT*.md
**/*PHASE*.md
**/*WAVE*.md
**/*REPORT*.md
**/*DASHBOARD*.md
**/*MATRIX*.md
**/*ROADMAP*.md

